§ `ss 32, 33, 16A -- defences`

#ASSERT NOT `Is it a defence that I did not act wilfully` FALSE
#ASSERT `Is it a defence that I did not act wilfully` TRUE

`my warranty, notice on day 8` MEANS `My warranty` WITH
    `I am charged with a Part 3 offence` IS TRUE
    `I bought the food relying on a written warranty signed for my seller` IS TRUE
    `I had no reason to believe the food did not match it` IS TRUE
    `the sale would not have been the offence had the food matched it` IS TRUE
    `the warrantor resides outside Singapore` IS FALSE
    `I took reasonable steps to check it and did believe it` IS FALSE
    `the day the summons was served on me` IS (Date 1 7 2026)
    `the day both notices were delivered and posted` IS (Date 8 7 2026)

`my warranty, notice on day 9` MEANS `My warranty` WITH
    `I am charged with a Part 3 offence` IS TRUE
    `I bought the food relying on a written warranty signed for my seller` IS TRUE
    `I had no reason to believe the food did not match it` IS TRUE
