`a newspaper running my advert` MEANS `My advertisement charge` WITH
    `I only transmit communications and have no control over their content` IS FALSE
    `I publish advertisements and published this one in the ordinary course` IS TRUE
    `I ought reasonably to have known publishing it was an offence` IS FALSE
    `the Director-General had told me in writing it would be an offence` IS FALSE
    `I run or work in the food business the advertisement was for` IS FALSE

`my own advert in my own paper` MEANS `My advertisement charge` WITH
    `I only transmit communications and have no control over their content` IS FALSE
    `I publish advertisements and published this one in the ordinary course` IS TRUE
    `I ought reasonably to have known publishing it was an offence` IS FALSE
    `the Director-General had told me in writing it would be an offence` IS FALSE
    `I run or work in the food business the advertisement was for` IS TRUE

