    `I carried on an activity it forbids` IS FALSE
    `I neglected or refused to comply with it` IS FALSE
    `I failed to meet a condition in it` IS FALSE
    `I had a reasonable excuse` IS FALSE
    `I removed its copy affixed to food premises` IS TRUE
    `it was in force when I removed it` IS FALSE
